    "quick": "Turn {{company}}'s campaign goal, offer, and timeline into a coordinated launch kit using optional Cookbook context: audience `{{audience}}`, positioning `{{positioning}}`, voice `{{voice}}`, pillars `{{pillars}}`, approved proof `{{proof}}`, formats `{{formats}}`, and constraints `{{constraints}}`. Define the strategic choice, message architecture, channel roles, asset requirements, owners, dependencies, budget assumptions, measurement, risks, and approval gates. This is a plan, not an authorization to publish, send, or spend.",
